# No secrets required for local development of pages.
# The contact form posts to FormSubmit (free) and delivers to
# info@globalechoesireland.ie. The first live submission sends an
# activation email to that inbox — click the confirmation link once.
#
# Newsletter (MailerLite). Add these in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment
# Variables, then redeploy. Leave them unset locally unless you are testing signup.
#
# MAILERLITE_API_TOKEN=
# MAILERLITE_GROUP_ID=
#
# Website analytics
# Vercel: enable Analytics and Speed Insights in the project dashboard.
# Google Analytics 4 (G-9J718MWMGV). Loaded only after cookie consent.
# Override only if you change the GA property:
# VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-9J718MWMGV
